	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName>Gallus</persName> ille, cui 4. novembris credidisti <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>literas, bona fide reddidit et mature satis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Iam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>etiam, cum consedi scripturus has, commodum a <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><placeName ref="l473">Sangallo</placeName> per <persName ref="p6683">Barptolomaeum Steckium</persName> illae quoque adferuntur, quas <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>scripsisti <placeName ref="l558">Witenbergae</placeName> 1. februarii.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Gratias ergo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ago domino, qui res nostras bene fortunat, et te <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>hortor, ut timeas deum et frequenter ores <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>institutionis meae mea manu scriptae et tibi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>traditae memineris.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Per caetera sic habe: pauc<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>is omnia absolvere cogor propter negotiorum turbas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Lectiones mihi placent, placent praeceptores; perge <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ergo ac sis diligens in Graeca et Latina lingua <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sic, ut theologiae non obliviscaris.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Exercitatio <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>imprimis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>necessaria, est quae maxime instruit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Volo ergo te scribere, declamare, disputare, noctes <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>atque dies legere.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Cave, ne per sodales perdaris,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>das du nitt zum koͤüthanen und biersuffer werdist.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Placent sodales fratres <persName ref="p4554">Collini</persName>, quos ex me salutabis, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nec ingratus ero illorum in te benevolentiae <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et beneficiis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cave tibi a nimis sumptibus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Volo, ut <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>singulis nundinis <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiensibus</placeName> supputationem r<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>erum tuarum consignes et mittas, ut solebas ex <placeName ref="l491">Ar<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>gentina</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Si videro te frugalem et diligentem, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>addam sponte 40 aureis auctionem et quidem <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>necessariam.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Nolo te egere, nolo sordicie tibi <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>contrahas morbos et plura deinceps exponas in <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>medicos; sobrietatem tamen et frugalitatem <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>requiro.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nolo, in aedes <persName ref="p2095">Melanchthonis</persName> concedas; nolo e<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nim illi augere per te invidiam apud eos, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>qui nos oderunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Metuo nimis magnos sumptus, et n<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>e a ditioribus apud illum vexeris.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Dabis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ei literas et duo exempla, alterum Summae, alterum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Apologiae.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ita vide, ut diligenter <placeName ref="l427">Ro<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>stochium</placeName> <persName>Philippo</persName> consultore d. <persName>Davidi</persName> cures <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>literas et duo exempla.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Reliqua duo tibi serva <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>et lege.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Si non magnis sumptibus et tuto et commode <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>fieri posset, cuperem te videre <placeName ref="l427">Rostochi<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>um</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>salutare <persName>Chytraeum</persName>, cui te commendavi, et videre <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>ibi mare Balticum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Si non potes <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>per invidiam commode agere <placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergae</placeName> (me<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>tuo enim, ne mea responsione irritarem <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>irritabiles alioquin) recta concede <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ad d. <persName ref="p8386">Andream Hyperium</persName>, qui tibi offert <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>hospitium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nolo tamen te inde discedere nisi <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>consilio <persName>Philippi</persName>, nisi non <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>possis haerere <placeName ref="l558">Wit<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>tenbergae</placeName>, nisi acceperis literas testimoniales.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Si ingruerint bella, consilio <persName>Philippi</persName> e<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>t bonorum virorum utere.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Non est, quod ullos <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>m<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>ihi mittas libros; nam dudum illos habui, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>quos mittere volebas.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Pro his dumtaxat <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>literis tuis <placeName ref="l473">Sangallensi</placeName> mercatori 3 batzios solvi.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Interim nolo, ut parcas sumptibus, quod <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>literas attinet, ut semper sciam, quomodo vivas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Com<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>mode redduntur per <persName ref="p6683">Steckium</persName> ex <placeName ref="l284">Lipsia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1227">Fro<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>schovero</persName> mandavi, ut tibi mittat pecunias et <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>dictionarium; iussi, mittat 22 <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>taleros, qui si 20 aliis in autumno datis addantur, efficient <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>circiter 45 gl.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te mater, frater, <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>sorores, generi; patruus valde miser, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/><persName>Brigida</persName>.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Plura non possum.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Time deum, <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>sedulo ora, sis diligens, modestus, gratus <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>deo et hominibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, dilectissime fi<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>li.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 14. martii 1556.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z26"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Dilecto meo filio <persName ref="p487">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <placeName ref="l862">Helvetio</placeName>, <placeName ref="l558">Wit<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>tenbergae</placeName> agenti etc.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z5"/>An <persName ref="p487">Heinrych Bullingern</persName> <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>zuͦ <lb xml:id="p4z7"/><placeName ref="l558">Wittemberg</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
